            "review_text": "bjhsl\nHong Kong, China38 contributions\n0\nDelicious rice sheet rolls\nNov 2022\nThe grilled items are nice, but the real deal are the rice paper rolls. You can order a little dish, like grilled meats and vegetable and the rice paper. Then you need to roll it all together into a little burrito, dip into fish sauce and enjoy. We've tried every dish. The portions are small, so we had 2 sets of rice paper and 7 or 8 of the little dishes. Seems to be very popular also with the locals and everyone ordered the rice paper rolls.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 30, 2022",
