            "review_text": "Howard S\n5 contributions\n0\nAmazing feast!\nNov 2018 • Friends\nI ate here on the advise of some friends and it was so good, I brought another group to dine with me. Every dish was amazing--so delicate, beautifully prepared, and delicious. Must order the rice rolls, the shrimp vermicelli, and salted egg salad and especially the two fish specialties cooked in tin foil, the tilapia and the seafood stew. The tilapia is extremely succulent and tasty--you will return to this restaurant.\nAnd the service was impeccable as well.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 3, 2018",
