            "review_text": "karen w\n76 contributions\n0\nGreat food\nAug 2017 • Friends\nWe love to eat here, with a group of friends, as this food is great to share, and so, so tasty. All the different sauces are amazing, from the curry, to the coconut, to the mayonnaise. \n\nThe mackeral is my favourite, and so far, I've had the curry and mayonnaise sauce, and they seem to be gluten free. Portions are large and reasonably priced, so we are usually over-full for about 110k per head - and we stuff ourselves! Could easily eat less, but we like to order lots of variety and then share. Prawns are really good too, if you don't mind shelling them. \n\nThe resultant is not so pretty - or clean, but the food has never given us any issues, hygiene-wise. I just avoid needing to use the bathroom!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 4, 2017",
