            "review_text": "HaijoLee\nStavanger, Norway719 contributions\n0\nHidden gem in a back alley Saigon!\nJul 2016 • Couples\nI went here 3 times last year,\nAnd 3 times this year. \nHidden in a back alley, but easy to find if you have the adress. \nLocation: 10min from ben thanh market\nNot too far away from downtown. \n\nFood is excellent. They cook and prepare the food with their signature tinfoil. \nEverything is cooked or grilled in this tinfoil paper. Thats why the dishes have the good smell/ aroma. \n\nI can personally recommend:\nTheir famous sticky rice \"xoi\"\nThe softshell crab dish\nAnd the fresh summer springrolls\nWith all of their ingredients,\nBeef, pork, sausage, octopus and all the fresh vegetables. \nThey come in very small quantity. \n\nPrice level: mid range average\nTable full of dishes + drinks for 2:\n400,000-450,000 VND\nRead more\nWritten August 8, 2016",
